00:06:37,600 --> 00:06:40,460
We buy the ticket, but there's no one checking the tickets all

172
00:06:40,460 --> 00:06:40,820
the time.

173
00:06:40,820 --> 00:06:41,700
Oh, yeah, yeah.

174
00:06:41,700 --> 00:06:42,660
That is a good example.

