and he doesn't, and, you know, like you want him,

186
00:07:09,560 --> 00:07:14,060
and you want the electrician to, you know, to do a good job,

187
00:07:14,260 --> 00:07:16,460
you might actually deliberately tip, right.

188
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:17,440
So, oh, we don't tip.

189
00:07:17,520 --> 00:07:20,220
Well, this time I'm tipping, right, and that way,

190
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,440
the person is worried that they're going

191
00:07:22,440 --> 00:07:24,560
to lose your patronage, right.

