00:07:32,340 --> 00:07:35,240
and then people will notice you and probably treat you better.

197
00:07:35,840 --> 00:07:37,000
So, all right.

198
00:07:37,420 --> 00:07:39,100
Now, notice, this is a totally real model.

199
00:07:39,100 --> 00:07:41,260
So, this has nothing to do with the number of identity, actually.

200
00:07:41,860 --> 00:07:44,320
People often go and throw the two together

201
00:07:44,320 --> 00:07:45,300
as if they're the same thing.

202
00:07:45,760 --> 00:07:46,960
They're totally different models.

203
00:07:47,760 --> 00:07:49,240
So, efficiency wage models, nothing to do

204
00:07:49,240 --> 00:07:50,200
with the number of identity.

